  "source_note": "Mixamo's API returned 403 Api Key required, so the clip was not re-downloaded through a logged-in session. The file is the official Mixamo FBX of this exact title on the uniform mixamorig skeleton (Y-bot upper-arm length 0.274 m). It is not a different animation. Character Arm-Space was not widened.",
  "retarget": "ForeArm maps to Arm.001 and Hand to Arm.002, same as PR #215. Kaelen's arm rest is about 57 degrees below Y-bot's T-pose, so a raw rest-delta (which reproduces Dual Weapon Combo exactly, where the binds match) does not reproduce this guard. The shipped pose copies each Mixamo bone's world orientation onto Kaelen. Bone lengths stay Kaelen's. Net ground drift removed. Frames that would sink the feet were lifted.",
