  "grip": "Unchanged. KAELEN_sword_L/R stay bone-parented to mixamorig:LeftArm.002 and mixamorig:RightArm.002. Parent error at rest is 0. The blade stays on the hand's local Z (dot 0.97), the grip Derek passed on Dual Weapon Combo. Handle samples sit about 8 cm from the hand head.",
